    {
      "uid": "zhcn:135b52b2b1e03c39ebec1165",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可能是画面太过冲击，害我心里的感想不小心脱口而出！\n现场所有人都盯着我看。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed9b071282a35cf03309153a3c76a2adade80fb4cc9bf2481b78488b3f4174a8",
