    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:695226f4ddffe5a8ec8ef933",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然距离当天还有好几天，但心里已经非常地期待又紧张……\n为了缓和自己的心情，我决定出门散步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2938310755fafb01dbb557dcffce360556a7d44d0c78f00cfddc2d9b02ccb20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
