      "uid": "zhcn:04057dc4ce26ee78646c90e3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可疑的人哪会说自己可疑啊！\n眼睛瞪那么大一直盯着看干嘛……小鬼们快躲到我后面！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c11f1b475521b9928107b10dcd9b88f4f01fed2856feecd15f53910e9f8da74",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
